1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,048
Month one with a new tech
partner is usually great.

2
00:00:03,225 --> 00:00:04,247
Quick replies.

3
00:00:04,267 --> 00:00:06,084
Senior people on every call.

4
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:10,649
By month six? New faces, slower
replies, and everything’s “next week.”

5
00:00:10,669 --> 00:00:13,678
With QUAICU, one engineer
stays with you the whole way.

6
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:15,832
So month twelve feels like month one.

